00 处，他（S1）奋力喝道：<d>[Chinese] 破！</d> 剑刃与狐尾同时迸发金色能量，充满画面。最后一秒镜头以快速速度大幅度拉远，显出二人身影如微小剪影，破开浩瀚流光之天。\\n\\noverall_soundscape: 深色云团翻涌的闷响渐强，至高潮化作利剑出鞘的锐响与金色能量炸裂的爆发声，余韵回荡。\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music: 00:17.000 起至终帧推向号角与打击乐的凯旋式高潮，结尾干脆收束。\\n\\n| **转场** | 落幅大远景、段末自然淡出                                                                                                                       |\\n\",\"negativePrompt\":\"\",\"taskType\":\"\",\"refs\":[],\"refAudios\":[],\"refVideos\":[],\"genImage\":{\"imageFile\":\"6d9953160c096fecdad424f480953c97a8e149175bf569503429522655e71dfa.png\",\"fileName\":\"\"},\"continuityFromPrev\":true,\"referenceVideo\":{\"videoFile\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"\",\"type\":\"input\",\"subfolder\":\"\"},\"_videoFrameCount\":175,\"previewFps\":24}],\"globalCommon\":{\"commonEnabled\":false,\"commonCollapsed\":false,\"prompt\":\"\",\"refs\":[],\"refAudios\":[],\"refVideos\":[]}}},\"shots\":[{\"id\":\"mt1gbi11o9g6y\",\"durationSec\":5,\"prompt\":\"一个女人在路边走，看见旁边有一只狗\",\"negativePrompt\":\"bad video\",\"startImage\":null,\"endImage\":null}],\"keyframes\":[{\"id\":\"mt1gbi11o9g6y\",\"imageFile\":\"\",\"width\":0,\"height\":0,\"start\":0,\"length\":124,\"frameCount\":124,\"durationSec\":5,\"prompt\":\"一个女人在路边走，看见旁边有一只狗\",\"negativePrompt\":\"bad video\",\"isStartFrame\":true,\"isEndFrame\":false}],\"durationSec\":5}",
